来の夢はパン屋さんという家庭的な一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前向きな性格でなんにでも素直に取り組むが、若干ドジでよく失敗する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか自分に自信がなく、何かを決めたりすることが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を『仲間』と認めてくれている自警団のみんなをとても大切に思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5475","sourceWorkId":"21265","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも素直で明るい、表情豊かな女の子。 自警団ではマスコット的な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理が得意で趣味はお菓子作り、将来の夢はパン屋さんという家庭的な一面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前向きな性格で何にでも積極的に取り組むが、若干ドジでよく失敗する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか自分に自信がなく、自分で何かを決めることが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を “仲間” と認めてくれている自警団のみんなを、とても大切に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【異能： 人狼化 －ウェアウルフ－】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その身を狼に変化させ、五感や身体能力を大幅に向上させる能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“狼化” といっても外見の変化は、耳としっぽが生えてくる程度のもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先輩、お祭りですよっ！ ハロウィンですよっ！　わくわくしますよねっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31071"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31071","value":"2年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a08abf85eefbc5264902bda19ef27d4064be0f50ca531179d2442502dcebb7f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/31aebc8b72378ae827a6a06332d992ecbc5664976e0f3254fa51c73490a7b2f0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋かな","creatorId":"vndb:s280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s280","name":"藤森 ゆき奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118103:31071:6016:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24607","characterName":"三刀屋 瀬奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"31072","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118103"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5476"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24607"},"originalCharacterName":"三刀屋 瀬奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Japanese-style beauty with sharp eyes. Contrary to her dignified appearance, she has a cheerful mischievous personality. She likes making pranks and laughing, when she goes too far she ends up having to write a written apology."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Among the vigilantes, she has a soft spot for Fuuka, and likes flirting with her. She's the type to solve her problems by acting before thinking. She is a master swordsman and his very good at close combat."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If I believe the person to be evil, I will not hesitate to point my sword for justice.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ability: Sixth Senses"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Strengthen insight around her surroundings."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"True ability: Reproduction"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She can copy a single ability users body type but not the ability itself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24607"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団”11月”の団員で、3年生。きりりとした目元の和風美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凛とした振る舞いとは裏腹にやんちゃな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪戯が大好きで、笑って済むものから始末書を書く羽目になるものまで幅広い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に楓花がお気に入りで、よくちょっかいを出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛瑠にももっと絡んでいきたいのだがクールすぎるリアクションに『迷惑がられているかも』と若干躊躇している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さばさばした明るい性格の現実主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えるよりも身体を動かしながら物事を解決していくタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣術の使い手で近接戦闘能力はかなり高い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5476","sourceWorkId":"21265","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"きりりとした目元の和風美人。 凛とした振る舞いとは裏腹に、やんちゃで明るい性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イタズラが好きで、笑って済むものもあれば、やり過ぎて始末書を書くハメになることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団の中では特に楓花がお気に入りで、よくちょっかいを出している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"考えるよりも身体を動かしながら物事を解決していくタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣術の使い手で、近接戦闘能力はかなり高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【異能： 第六感 －シックスセンス－】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"閃きを強化し頭の回転を良くする、という能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘時には異能を活かし、意外性に満ちた立ち回りを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「信じる者が悪だったら、わたしは迷わず正義に刃を向ける」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31072"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31072","value":"3年生"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af6fc8db33ae375807d5104b6cc58d7f5da0ee21c4235ea1c6793844f8eefd2b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/3345930b55cf2d992475a5d63dc397b07c76b7ee1c09b7e3b4f2f63e94a136cb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"儀武ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s263","name":"儀武 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118103:31072:4744:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24608","characterName":"星崎 心音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"31073","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118103"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5478"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24608"},"originalCharacterName":"星崎 心音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ability: Aircraft"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can freely control the winds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ability 2: Healing light"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can heal others but not herself."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Healing light will hurt herself whoever she heals."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24608"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団”11月”の団員。先代の団長を務めていたが留年し、2度目の3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりがよく頼りがいもある、優しいみんなのお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でも怒ると怖い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼られ過ぎるキャラクタのせいか色恋には縁がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少女漫画が好き。多くの相談が恋愛がらみのため、参考のために読み始めたらハマってしまった。漫画のようなドラマチックな恋愛に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団の任務中に弟を死なせてしまっており、それ以来任務には厳格に当たっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5478","sourceWorkId":"21265","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりが良く優しいお姉さん。 “11月”の先代団長を務めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怒ると怖い。 自警団の任務中に弟を死なせてしまっており、任務には厳格に当たっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく恋愛相談を受けるため、参考にと少女漫画を読み始めたらハマってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"漫画のようなドラマチックな恋愛に憧れているが、今のところ色恋には縁がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【異能： 風力操作 －エアクラフト－】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲の大気を自由自在に操る能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"風の刃を飛ばしたり、相手の飛び道具を逸らしたり、高い状況対応力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「男の子でしょ？　強くなって、好きな女の子を守れるようになりなさい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31073"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31073","value":"3年生（留年して 2度目）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65e3e3cb0e8d47c5fb7212e6d4644c6b43ad78a55455649017fa2d3d96b177c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7dd79a978eee551fa8edd8981301239e48a2c89d75c2a9ee30841694464fff33.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118103:31073:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24609","characterName":"羽鳥 愛瑠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"31074","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118103"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5477"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24609"},"originalCharacterName":"羽鳥 愛瑠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with a quiet demeanor that makes little changes in her expression. She is usually quiet, but when she opens her mouth, she tends to speak with harsh words. However, she doesn't mean to be malicious, just brutally honest, so she is perceived as a kind of an airhead."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She always wears dark black stockings and rarely shows her bare skin. In reality, she yearns to be a normal girl, to talk and fall in love. She comes to the school with a certain purpose, and becomes deeply involved with Takuto."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ability: Simple Word"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The ability to see-through lies. Although if she herself lies, a snake tattoo gets progressively closer to her heart each time she lies, until she dies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'm not sleepy... It's just that this topic is boring.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24609"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団”11月”の団員で、1年生。おっとりした印象で、表情の変化も乏しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本物静かだが、口を開くと外見に似合わず歯に衣着せぬ物言いが飛び出す毒舌家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪意からではなく素直さの発露なので、ある種の天然キャラとして受け取られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"濃い黒のストッキングを常に着用しており、素肌を見せることはほとんどない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"積極的に他人に関わることはなく、距離を置きがちだが本当はおしゃべりや恋愛など、普通の女の子っぽいことに憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的を持って学園にやってきており、その部分で拓翔と深く関わっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5477","sourceWorkId":"21265","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした印象で、表情の変化が乏しい女の子。 普段は静かだが、口を開くと毒舌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ毒舌も悪意はなく素直さの発露なので、ある種の天然さとして受け取られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に濃い黒のストッキングを着用しており、素肌を見せることはほとんどない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当はおしゃべりや恋愛など、普通の女の子っぽいことに憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある目的を持って学園にやってきており、その部分で拓翔と深く関わっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【異能： 不明】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"異能を持っているのは間違いないが、詳細については誰も知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「眠いんじゃなくて、ただ……話がつまらないだけです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31074"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31074","value":"1年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdc8c3566dc1c4c795ef0ee90f8c72de3252b841259a20df3bdde6c55a14ebe8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c08a772eaa7092e8829a22780b7f6b765c0a95e47d3f3b9b10b840b9085c5537.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大橋歩夕","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118103:31074:6174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30467","characterName":"有坂 拓翔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"31075","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118103"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5479"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30467"},"originalCharacterName":"有坂 拓翔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has steadily built up his track record and trust since he was a first grader and became the head of a vigilante. He has deep attention to his surroundings, and can advance into trouble because of this knowledge."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He wants the power of the gem to save his younger sister who died due to his own ability. He volunteered to be a vigilante because he thought it would be more convenient to take the gem that way. He's been prepared to sacrifice everything for that purpose, but also has conflict of not wanting to hurt the friends he's made."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I will steal the gem. However, I won't hurt my friends.\""},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ability: Forced Rewind -Time Return-"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Has the ability to automatically rewind time to 3 days before after 4 weeks have passed. He wasn't able to control it initially, but was able to with a certain item."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30467"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異能者の集う学園、貴台学園の3年生で、自警団”11月”の隊長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"1年生の頃から実績と信頼を地道に積み上げ、隊長職に。他の部隊からの評価も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その実、宝石の奪取を目的にしている人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の異能がきっかけで死んだ妹を宝石の力で救うため、宝石奪取に有利だという理由で自警団に志願。着々と準備を進めてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"困っている人をほっとけない情の深い性分。周りへの気配りもでき、面倒事を進んで引き受けるなど周囲の評価は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目的のためならすべてを犠牲にする覚悟だが、これまで共に過ごした仲間たちを利用したり傷つけたりはしたくないとも考え、苦悩する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5479","sourceWorkId":"21265","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"1年生の頃から実績と信頼を地道に積み上げ、自警団の団長になった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"情が深く気配りもでき、面倒事も進んで引き受けるため周囲の評価は高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の異能がきっかけで死んだ妹を救うため、宝石の力を必要としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自警団に志願したのも、宝石を奪取するのに都合が良いと考えたため。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目的のためならすべてを犠牲にする覚悟だが、これまで共に過ごした仲間たちを傷つけたくないとも考え、苦悩している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【異能： 強制逆行 －タイムリターン－】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"4週間が経過すると、自動的に 3日前に時間が巻き戻る能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の意思で制御できなかったが、アイテムを利用することで任意のタイミングで発動できるようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「宝石は奪う。 でも仲間を傷つけたりはしない」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31075"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"31075","value":"3年"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/64eff174c0e5d6bd5cad0f1889bf482e476f4447db9b0f806d7daa60fc7a4d65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5abdd8f795a577742ad07343217d4c5d84b3fd2d3835c4868c93f04a242308f.webp","width":256,"height":222,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田丸篤志"